        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h1>CONTACT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果发现BUG，或者有惊天动地的想法要分享，随时联系我就行。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bug or you have some ideas to tell, feel free to contact me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >バグを見つけたり、何かアイデアがあったら、気軽に連絡してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群：1003196091</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:Email：563796786@qq.com\">Email：563796786@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;5 Min Space Battle&gt; is a fast-paced third-person 3D space combat shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your space fighter to destroy enemies → gain experience → strengthen yourself, and face the upcoming BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Multiple Space Fighters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of uniquely styled space fighters to pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighters are equipped with distinct weapon types, including but not limited to projectile weapons, laser weapons, drones, shields, and repair systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Multiple Difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 1 is relatively gentle: after 5 minutes of combat, a random boss will appear, with slightly fewer rewards. It is ideal for familiarizing yourself with space fighters and stably earning in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 2 is the game’s standard difficulty: two bosses will appear, requiring you to adapt to their combinations while leveraging your space fighter’s unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Randomness:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss appearances and upgrade card draws are random, adding unpredictability to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor enemies also spawn randomly, so you’ll need to eliminate as many targets as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses will absorb some minor enemies on the field to strengthen themselves—the more they absorb, the stronger they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game, all space fighter pilots!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;5 Min Space Battle&gt; is a fast-paced third-person 3D space combat shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your space fighter to destroy enemies → gain experience → strengthen yourself, and face the upcoming BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Multiple Space Fighters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of uniquely styled space fighters to pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighters are equipped with distinct weapon types, including but not limited to projectile weapons, laser weapons, drones, shields, and repair systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Multiple Difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 1 is relatively gentle: after 5 minutes of combat, a random boss will appear, with slightly fewer rewards. It is ideal for familiarizing yourself with space fighters and stably earning in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 2 is the game’s standard difficulty: two bosses will appear, requiring you to adapt to their combinations while leveraging your space fighter’s unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Randomness:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss appearances and upgrade card draws are random, adding unpredictability to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor enemies also spawn randomly, so you’ll need to eliminate as many targets as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses will absorb some minor enemies on the field to strengthen themselves—the more they absorb, the stronger they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game, all space fighter pilots!</p>",
        "short_description": "5Min Space Battle is a fast-paced third-person space shooter. Pilot different fighters through intense battles, eliminate enemy threats, and level up your fighter to boost its performance. Each fighter has unique combat capabilities, defining your playstyle in thrilling 5-minute skirmishes.",
